# Models fetched by scripts/fetch_models.sh (zoo compile pinned by sha256).
# Vendored files in this directory (no rows here) are exact device artifacts
# committed via the .gitignore negation:
#   - yolov5m_vehicles.hef — custom 1-class compile (variant-coupled NMS;
#     the generic zoo yolov5m would mismatch the postprocess config)
#   - tiny_yolov4_license_plates.hef — license-plate detector, no zoo build
#   - paddle_ocr_v5_mobile_recognition_nv12.hef — plate OCR, no zoo build
#   - yolov5m_vehicles.bin / scdepthv3.bin — AMPK packages (app.yaml
#     spec.models paths) exported from the platform model rows via
#     platform-api `GET /api/v1/ai/models/:model_id/export`; the embedded
#     HEF bytes are identical to the vendored .hef above/below, so the
#     packages stay in sync with the artifacts the app registers at runtime.
#     Regenerate after replacing any .hef (the package metadata pins the
#     HEF sha256).
# Zoo pinning rationale: v5.3.0/hailo15h matches the device firmware
# (HailoRT 5.3.0). Re-verify with `hailortcli parse-hef` before bumping.
0c7c7e5958e75f722bd3355106dba21d2c13f737dab3f627701844b34ed9f7e7	scdepthv3.hef	https://hailo-model-zoo.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/ModelZoo/Compiled/v5.3.0/hailo15h/scdepthv3.hef
